ities filled with troubled creatures and charming NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Narrative-Driven Campaign</strong> \u2013 A heartfelt story about community, empathy, and fighting for a better future in an increasingly less colorful world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Colorful, Expressive Art</strong> \u2013 Hand-drawn 2D art with expressive animation and a distinct, charming aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Lofi Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 The cozy playlist matches the emotional tone of your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Forgiving Roguelite Progression</strong> \u2013 Keep your unlocks if you fail an encounter, while restarting the current map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect for Solo Players</strong> \u2013 Designed for  strategic exploration at your own pace.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Magic will disappear forever, unless you save it! In this wholesome and approachable card game, you debate monsters, recruit friends, and start a world-changing movement. Balance your team and your decks carefully, and use your debate skills to convince fantastical opponents to join your side!",
